{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦調查局正在調查其全國犯罪信息中心疑似遭到黑客入侵的事件。該數據庫是連接聯邦、州和地方執法機構的重要信息平台，被全美執法部門用於共享通緝令、進行背景審查以及查詢在逃人員等信息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587356.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.060000+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:29:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"7e62af53d21a95d71d45c3d21c32cf455c4732fa13ef6d10c0aeacaa7d850460","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}